# Example
## Apps
browser|app>google-chrome-stable      # identifier|action>data

## Links
search|link>https://google.com        # explicit action + data
video|link>youtube.com                # shorthand, no protocol

## Directories
docs|dir>$HOME/Documents              # directory path as data

## Scripts
monitor|term>htop                     # terminal command
shutdown|sys                          # shorthand, no data

## Menus
DEFAULT|list                          # default action if none given
add|dbmkmenu>-l HISTORY -a add        # nested dbmkmenu action
